==Battleground==
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*2 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns.
**3 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.
**5 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn, delay 19.33~20 seconds<sup>580f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stack [[Bombercat]] on the initial Shadow Boxer K, then spam meatshields, [[Courier Cat]], [[Jelly Dumpling Cat]], and any other units you brought for speeding up the continuation stages.

